title: "Deep32: Retrieval-augmented question answering for network and security engineering"
abstract: >-
  Deep32 answers network and security engineering questions from a local, versioned corpus of RFCs and vendor
  documentation. An LLM agent is given search and lookup tools over the Model Context Protocol and a fixed
  procedure: look up every identifier, read whole sections, check the status of every RFC cited, and verify
  every quotation against the source text before answering.
